                title "Investigate rehoming the temp bag/amalgam readings out of the document arena — REJECTED: the GSR_ANY amalgam escapes the matcher into the apply/selected/trace layers (single_rule.rs threads it as the target reading), so eviction would force a two-namespace reading id through the whole engine; the shared arena IS the port of the C++ Reading& unification. Resolved by drawing the Matcher view boundary around a readings-arena &mut instead"
                priority 2
                log (
                    {
                        at 2026-07-22T12:07:58.95975Z
