                        kind @decision
                        text "Operator decision (2026-07-22): step cancelled after investigation. Evidence: get_sub_reading's GSR_ANY amalgam id is consumed at single_rule.rs:421/690 and dispatch.rs:48/57 as the rule's target reading — it flows into apply_to, the selected/removed lists, and trace, i.e. the ACTION layer, not just matching; match_bag_of_tags (run_contextual_test.rs) is matcher-confined but resolves through the same subtree. Evicting bags to a scratch pool therefore requires a Doc|Bag id enum through matcher AND action layers — engine-wide churn, zero behavior change, two resolution paths where the C++ has one (its Reading& unifies scratch and document readings; the port's single arena is the faithful analogue). Superseded by the matcher-view boundary: store.readings stays &mut in the view (transient-slot lifecycle only, documented), everything else in the document is shared."
                    }

